      "normalizedSource": "When this property’s value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), SceneKit does not have this limitation: you may use a material’s [`diffuse`](scnmaterial/diffuse.md) property to provide a color or texture that is visible under direct lighting, and its [`ambient`](scnmaterial/ambient.md) property to provide a different color or texture for areas not directly illuminated.",
